WEBVTT

01:37.009 --> 01:39.950
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.150 --> 01:42.039
[Episode 17]

01:44.990 --> 01:46.750
If you're sleepy, take a nap in the back.

01:47.470 --> 01:49.920
If you're done drinking, put the lid back and place it here.

01:50.400 --> 01:51.600
Don't spill water on yourself.

02:05.030 --> 02:06.190
After finishing this trip

02:06.190 --> 02:07.700
and deducting all the expenses,

02:07.730 --> 02:08.870
we'll have about 700 yuan left.

02:15.500 --> 02:16.660
While on the road,

02:16.690 --> 02:17.900
I've been thinking about something.

02:18.670 --> 02:21.350
Driving a truck is really tough.

02:22.030 --> 02:22.990
Let's

02:23.390 --> 02:24.230
work hard for a few years.

02:24.910 --> 02:26.710
After we put our son through college

02:26.710 --> 02:28.130
and he finds a good job,

02:28.910 --> 02:30.030
we can take a breather.

02:30.250 --> 02:31.079
We'll stop driving

02:31.310 --> 02:32.430
and take a good rest.

02:40.329 --> 02:41.700
Or

02:42.190 --> 02:44.390
we can buy a small ship.

02:46.270 --> 02:49.310
It doesn't matter how many shipping deals we can get.

02:49.310 --> 02:52.670
If we can't get any deals, we'll just enjoy the scenery on the ship.

02:52.750 --> 02:53.710
You like the idea?

03:21.840 --> 03:22.690
Mom.

03:23.010 --> 03:23.940
You're back.

03:27.750 --> 03:28.840
Son, you're back.

03:28.960 --> 03:29.750
Where's Dad?

03:30.320 --> 03:31.040
Sleeping.

03:34.270 --> 03:35.000
Did everything go smoothly?

03:36.840 --> 03:37.520
Yeah.

03:39.380 --> 03:41.829
The client wanted to dock my pay because I arrived late.

03:41.850 --> 03:44.650
Your dad rolled up his sleeves and made him pay the full amount.

03:44.980 --> 03:46.750
He's like your bodyguard.

03:46.780 --> 03:47.820
Great.

03:48.829 --> 03:49.990
Luckily, it didn't come to blows.

03:49.990 --> 03:51.079
Otherwise,

03:51.120 --> 03:52.430
the money we earned

03:52.550 --> 03:53.579
couldn't even cover the medical bills.

03:54.320 --> 03:55.750
Dad is experienced in this.

03:55.950 --> 03:57.120
Back when he was a seafarer,

03:57.500 --> 03:59.270
there were also people who tried to skip out on paying.

03:59.500 --> 04:00.350
He just got physical.

04:08.270 --> 04:09.090
What's wrong, Mom?

04:09.550 --> 04:10.570
Did you two have a fight?

04:12.110 --> 04:12.830
No.

04:15.180 --> 04:16.500
I wish we had.

04:17.970 --> 04:19.750
Your dad didn't give me the chance.

04:20.240 --> 04:20.890
What do you mean?

04:24.420 --> 04:25.420
During the trip,

04:25.710 --> 04:27.490
over 2,000 kilometers in total,

04:28.330 --> 04:29.730
your father kept a long face

04:29.750 --> 04:31.040
the whole time.

04:33.030 --> 04:35.159
And he said to me a total of maybe…

04:35.670 --> 04:36.880
200 words?

05:07.760 --> 05:08.370
Boss Xie.

05:11.420 --> 05:12.280
Mr. Shao.

05:12.430 --> 05:13.260
Are you off work?

05:14.110 --> 05:15.310
I thought it was you from afar.

05:15.330 --> 05:16.060
It's really you.

05:18.150 --> 05:19.730
You're in charge of

05:19.870 --> 05:20.940
buying groceries now?

05:21.990 --> 05:24.360
Well, Haihong

05:24.430 --> 05:26.390
is busy driving the truck.

05:27.110 --> 05:28.270
I'll do what I can to help.

05:28.530 --> 05:29.200
Yeah.

05:29.240 --> 05:30.030
Well,

05:30.060 --> 05:31.580
how's the publication of your book going?

05:34.430 --> 05:35.350
It's in the works.

05:35.720 --> 05:37.270
I don't have any publishing experience,

05:37.270 --> 05:38.110
so I'm learning as I go.

05:38.430 --> 05:39.170
Oh, right.

05:39.540 --> 05:41.480
There's something I wanted to talk to you about.

05:42.140 --> 05:43.340
Can we have a talk here?

05:43.470 --> 05:44.770
Okay.

05:44.800 --> 05:45.530
Come, sit here.

05:45.590 --> 05:45.950
Alright.

05:46.659 --> 05:47.420
Sit.

05:50.060 --> 05:51.190
Here is the thing.

05:51.980 --> 05:53.020
I have a suggestion

05:53.400 --> 05:54.940
that might seem immature.

05:54.980 --> 05:56.960
I'd like to share it with you

05:56.990 --> 05:59.000
to see if it's feasible.

05:59.190 --> 06:01.410
You're being so polite. What's it?

06:01.760 --> 06:04.210
You know, every year, many people

06:04.810 --> 06:06.590
drown in the canal.

06:06.710 --> 06:09.190
Yesterday, another person drowned upstream near Liu Village.

06:09.980 --> 06:11.540
No one is willing to retrieve the body.

06:12.300 --> 06:13.830
Here's what I'm thinking.

06:14.440 --> 06:16.940
Could you consider being an initiator

06:17.390 --> 06:19.070
to get some volunteers

06:19.100 --> 06:20.900
to form a canal rescue team

06:20.930 --> 06:22.490
that helps those

06:22.590 --> 06:24.390
who fall into the water?

06:24.990 --> 06:25.560
What do you think?

06:26.710 --> 06:27.910
Hold on, M-Mr. Shao.

06:27.910 --> 06:30.040
What exactly are you getting at?

06:31.720 --> 06:32.540
Here's the thing.

06:34.030 --> 06:35.550
As you know, the authorities are currently applying for

06:35.550 --> 06:37.190
World Heritage status for the canal.

06:37.990 --> 06:39.290
The heritage is not the canal

06:39.730 --> 06:41.440
but the canal culture.

06:41.909 --> 06:43.230
Speaking of culture,

06:44.230 --> 06:45.550
look at our Flower Street.

06:45.580 --> 06:46.930
What culture does it have?

06:48.040 --> 06:51.060
There were a few famous local female entertainers in history,

06:51.140 --> 06:52.300
but we can't

06:52.330 --> 06:54.650
use romantic tales to make our case.

06:55.659 --> 06:56.510
However,

06:57.550 --> 06:59.560
with good people who did good things,

06:59.590 --> 07:01.350
we can say this is a town

07:01.350 --> 07:02.640
with kind-hearted folks.

07:02.910 --> 07:05.300
That could be a characteristic of Flower Street,

07:05.330 --> 07:05.890
right?

07:08.360 --> 07:09.270
Mr. Shao,

07:10.070 --> 07:13.010
are you planning to write and publish something?

07:13.160 --> 07:14.050
No.

07:14.860 --> 07:17.430
Good people and good deeds

07:17.450 --> 07:19.870
are highly commendable.

07:20.020 --> 07:21.050
You'll do good things,

07:21.230 --> 07:22.180
and I'll praise you.

07:22.270 --> 07:23.480
It's a win-win.

07:23.790 --> 07:26.050
Then I should get half of the writing fee, right?

07:26.890 --> 07:28.530
Forget about that little bit of money.

07:28.550 --> 07:30.250
What matters is the honor.

07:33.740 --> 07:34.830
Alright, it's settled then.

07:35.260 --> 07:37.060
The honor goes to you,

07:37.100 --> 07:38.580
and the writing fee goes to me.

07:40.800 --> 07:42.110
If you say so,

07:42.110 --> 07:43.909
you're making me speechless.

07:44.540 --> 07:45.990
I'm just joking with you.

07:47.830 --> 07:48.470
No matter what,

07:48.470 --> 07:49.640
this is a serious matter.

07:49.820 --> 07:50.430
After I go home,

07:50.470 --> 07:52.230
I need to discuss it with my wife.

07:52.390 --> 07:54.090
I can only do it if she agrees.

07:54.130 --> 07:54.700
Alright.

07:55.100 --> 07:56.340
Then I'll wait for your reply.

07:56.740 --> 07:58.210
If the canal gets World Heritage status,

07:59.440 --> 08:00.950
it'll be able

08:01.540 --> 08:03.760
to flourish again.

08:03.870 --> 08:05.040
By then,

08:05.320 --> 08:07.300
you can truly return to the river.

08:08.250 --> 08:08.950
Alright.

08:09.260 --> 08:10.230
I'll be going.

08:10.450 --> 08:11.360
See you.

08:17.680 --> 08:19.070
Bye, Boss Xie.

08:42.049 --> 08:42.820
Boss Xie.

08:43.150 --> 08:44.280
What are you doing here?

08:44.670 --> 08:46.460
I came out for some fresh air.

08:47.890 --> 08:48.900
You're drinking?

08:49.020 --> 08:49.630
I'll grab a few more bottles.

08:49.670 --> 08:50.540
A few more.

09:00.110 --> 09:01.420
How's everything? Good?

09:02.570 --> 09:03.710
Just so-so.

09:06.580 --> 09:07.590
It's still cold.

09:10.870 --> 09:11.830
How about you?

09:11.910 --> 09:13.410
How's the long-haul driving going?

09:19.640 --> 09:21.060
Compared to seafaring,

09:21.290 --> 09:22.520
it's much more tiring.

09:22.710 --> 09:23.350
Is that so?

09:23.450 --> 09:24.590
With seafaring,

09:24.590 --> 09:26.060
ships don't go very fast,

09:26.460 --> 09:27.300
right?

09:27.500 --> 09:28.460
You don't have to

09:28.470 --> 09:30.830
stay focused all the time.

09:30.910 --> 09:32.110
Driving is different.

09:32.330 --> 09:34.810
When driving, you always have to keep your eyes on the road.

09:35.660 --> 09:37.240
After a whole day,

09:37.540 --> 09:38.920
you're sore all over,

09:39.800 --> 09:40.820
and your head buzzes.

09:41.630 --> 09:43.230
It's not so unbearable

09:43.680 --> 09:45.190
as long as you can make money.

09:45.830 --> 09:46.460
Right?

09:48.790 --> 09:51.270
Is your supermarket going well?

09:51.790 --> 09:52.550
Kind of.

09:52.570 --> 09:55.430
I can make about 200 yuan a day.

09:55.450 --> 09:56.250
That's pretty good.

09:56.280 --> 09:57.000
Yeah.

09:58.300 --> 10:01.160
Your wife must be happy now.

10:01.960 --> 10:03.100
I guess you could say that.

10:03.670 --> 10:07.950
I haven't been told off for over half a month.

10:08.460 --> 10:10.050
To be honest, I'm not used to it.

10:11.200 --> 10:13.110
That's not good for your health.

10:13.510 --> 10:14.670
I'll remind Yan

10:14.930 --> 10:16.680
to nag you more often.

10:16.710 --> 10:17.230
No, no, no.

10:17.230 --> 10:18.400
To give you a hard time.

10:18.660 --> 10:19.950
Will that make you feel better?

10:19.950 --> 10:20.830
Boss Xie, I'm begging you.

10:20.830 --> 10:21.310
Please.

10:21.360 --> 10:22.470
These days,

10:22.510 --> 10:24.000
every time we fight,

10:24.020 --> 10:25.790
it takes hours to appease her.

10:27.200 --> 10:28.510
I don't mind groveling a bit,

10:29.090 --> 10:32.330
but my lower back can't take it.

10:37.460 --> 10:38.170
My lower back can't take it.

10:38.200 --> 10:39.470
It can't?

10:42.280 --> 10:43.530
Well, Mr. Shao

10:43.760 --> 10:45.190
made a suggestion to me.

10:45.590 --> 10:46.770
He said I should

10:46.810 --> 10:49.560
form a canal rescue team.

10:49.580 --> 10:50.480
Are you interested?

10:52.350 --> 10:53.830
Rescue team?

10:59.550 --> 11:00.910
O-Okay.

11:01.310 --> 11:02.120
Well,

11:02.370 --> 11:05.050
if you want me in, I'm in.

11:05.330 --> 11:05.950
Right?

11:07.460 --> 11:09.680
I know I can count on you.

11:10.780 --> 11:12.770
As long as it doesn't affect my business.

11:17.870 --> 11:18.710
Boss Xie,

11:18.730 --> 11:20.770
don't you need to drive the truck?

11:21.710 --> 11:23.080
Does your wife know about this?

11:32.620 --> 11:33.560
Do you have cigarettes?

11:33.950 --> 11:34.830
Yes.

11:34.830 --> 11:35.750
Give me one.

11:40.230 --> 11:40.660
Here.

11:57.450 --> 11:58.410
Who are you bowing to?

11:58.430 --> 11:59.310
The river god.

11:59.520 --> 12:00.790
Didn't Mr. Zhou say

12:00.830 --> 12:03.920
the official from the Qing dynasty is the river god here?

12:05.070 --> 12:05.920
We should pay our respects.

12:05.940 --> 12:07.460
Of course.

12:08.790 --> 12:09.910
Oh, River God,

12:09.930 --> 12:10.960
I'm begging you.

12:11.150 --> 12:12.650
Please make

12:12.870 --> 12:15.910
this canal prosper again.

12:15.930 --> 12:17.040
Prosper again.

12:17.070 --> 12:18.190
Prosper again.

12:18.220 --> 12:21.070
Let us return to our ships.

12:21.110 --> 12:22.230
Return to our ships.

12:22.230 --> 12:23.330
Return…

12:23.440 --> 12:25.010
People like us

12:25.040 --> 12:26.990
love the smells of kerosene

12:27.030 --> 12:27.910
and diesel.

12:27.930 --> 12:29.400
We love those smells.

12:29.430 --> 12:30.470
We love the roars

12:30.490 --> 12:33.210
of the engine.

12:33.240 --> 12:33.960
Right.

12:33.980 --> 12:34.690
Please.

12:34.730 --> 12:35.610
We love that sound.

12:35.780 --> 12:36.390
Please.

12:36.410 --> 12:37.160
We beg you.

12:37.730 --> 12:38.590
Bless us.

12:38.850 --> 12:40.140
Please.

12:40.470 --> 12:41.440
Please.

13:05.790 --> 13:07.140
What are you doing?

13:07.160 --> 13:08.090
Why are you making all that noise?

13:08.120 --> 13:09.240
How can I sleep?

13:09.270 --> 13:10.060
It's late at night.

13:10.480 --> 13:11.960
Get on the bed and sleep.

13:11.980 --> 13:13.920
Why are you fiddling with that? Are you crazy?

13:34.070 --> 13:34.870
What's wrong?

13:38.310 --> 13:39.920
You should go back to the canal.

13:42.910 --> 13:44.160
I can see it.

13:44.180 --> 13:46.020
You're like a fish.

13:46.040 --> 13:48.190
You can't survive without water.

13:48.230 --> 13:50.480
What if you get sick from holding it in?

13:51.190 --> 13:52.310
I'm not holding anything in.

13:56.360 --> 13:57.600
I'm serious.

14:01.990 --> 14:04.120
Yuling said Mr. Shao wants you

14:04.150 --> 14:05.520
to form a canal rescue team, right?

14:08.360 --> 14:09.740
Yeah.

14:10.000 --> 14:11.670
I haven't decided whether to do it or not.

14:11.700 --> 14:12.180
Do it.

14:13.800 --> 14:15.030
As long as you're happy,

14:15.630 --> 14:16.510
I'll support you.

14:20.160 --> 14:21.920
Is this a prank?

14:33.990 --> 14:35.210
This family

14:35.710 --> 14:37.510
used to rely entirely on you.

14:38.430 --> 14:39.020
But now,

14:40.020 --> 14:41.770
I can share your burden.

14:42.630 --> 14:43.750
In the future, our son

14:43.960 --> 14:45.400
will surely be successful.

14:47.430 --> 14:48.230
Xie Tiancheng,

14:49.870 --> 14:51.670
I'm asking you

14:52.490 --> 14:54.830
to keep your spirits up.

14:58.310 --> 14:59.100
I will.

15:05.700 --> 15:08.410
I married you

15:09.990 --> 15:11.510
not because you were rich.

15:12.720 --> 15:15.360
It was just because you were nice and righteous.

15:16.070 --> 15:17.310
Even if you only had

15:18.230 --> 15:19.440
ten cents on you,

15:20.070 --> 15:20.740
you'd still look

15:21.430 --> 15:22.350
like a boss.

15:25.430 --> 15:26.990
The vibes you gave

15:28.690 --> 15:30.730
fascinated me back then.

15:37.710 --> 15:39.220
So you must not

15:41.000 --> 15:42.390
lose those spirits.

15:51.310 --> 15:53.830
I won't lose them. I won't.

15:55.100 --> 15:57.110
Do you understand what I'm saying?

15:57.110 --> 15:58.190
I do.

16:02.990 --> 16:04.000
Let's do some exercise

16:04.000 --> 16:05.590
so I won't lose you.

16:05.590 --> 16:06.110
Come here.

16:06.110 --> 16:06.990
It's the middle of the night.

16:06.990 --> 16:08.630
Our son is next door.

16:08.710 --> 16:09.980
One can do this anytime.

16:09.980 --> 16:11.150
I'm very serious now.

16:11.230 --> 16:12.410
Perfect timing.

16:12.590 --> 16:13.710
What I was talking about is important.

16:13.710 --> 16:14.350
Look at you.

16:14.370 --> 16:15.130
This is the most important thing.

16:15.190 --> 16:15.830
Anything else can wait.

16:19.150 --> 16:26.720
[Flower Street]

16:25.070 --> 16:25.830
Boss Xie.

16:27.000 --> 16:27.510
Boss Xie.

16:27.510 --> 16:28.790
Guys, they're there.

16:28.830 --> 16:29.310
Boss Xie.

16:29.310 --> 16:29.710
What's going on?

16:29.710 --> 16:30.600
You're to be interviewed.

16:30.630 --> 16:31.230
What?

16:31.230 --> 16:32.460
Come up. You're to be interviewed.

16:32.460 --> 16:33.870
The reporters are here to interview you.

16:33.890 --> 16:35.890
Where is the flag? Take out the flag.

16:39.470 --> 16:40.230
Alright.

16:40.310 --> 16:41.870
Hold this flag. They're going to take a photo.

16:41.870 --> 16:43.260
Come on. Take a photo.

16:43.310 --> 16:44.510
Everyone, come over.

16:44.510 --> 16:45.500
Look here.

16:45.620 --> 16:46.990
Okay, one, two, three.

16:46.990 --> 16:48.290
Smile.

16:48.630 --> 16:49.520
Good.

16:49.710 --> 16:50.830
One more shot.

16:50.870 --> 16:52.670
Come on, one, two, three.

16:52.710 --> 16:53.840
Cheese!

16:53.840 --> 16:54.470
Cheese!

16:54.470 --> 16:55.080
Good.

16:59.950 --> 17:01.310
As everyone knows,

17:01.170 --> 17:04.130
[Canal Rescue Team]

17:01.950 --> 17:03.590
this canal

17:03.590 --> 17:05.230
has a long history

17:04.220 --> 17:07.880
[Water Rescue]

17:05.230 --> 17:06.390
and a splendid culture.

17:07.750 --> 17:10.020
As people born by the canal,

17:11.430 --> 17:12.640
we feel

17:12.819 --> 17:14.349
it's our duty

17:14.349 --> 17:15.829
to keep

17:16.069 --> 17:17.829
people on the canal safe.

17:41.690 --> 17:45.700
[Building a Strong Lifeline on the Water]

17:42.110 --> 17:43.830
They brave the waves

17:43.860 --> 17:45.750
and fight in the water.

17:45.750 --> 17:46.820
They're selfless

17:46.880 --> 17:48.230
and dedicated to helping others.

17:48.230 --> 17:49.750
The virtue once embodied

17:49.750 --> 17:52.300
by Dr. Norman Bethune

17:52.350 --> 17:53.750
is now being carried forward

17:53.750 --> 17:56.230
by Xie Tiancheng

17:56.230 --> 17:57.550
and his canal rescue team.

17:57.590 --> 17:58.390
Awesome!

17:58.430 --> 17:59.870
Impressive!

18:00.350 --> 18:01.470
Alright, enough with the praise.

18:01.470 --> 18:03.350
I'm getting embarrassed.

18:03.350 --> 18:05.630
I-I didn't hear

18:05.630 --> 18:07.750
Xia's name in the article.

18:12.410 --> 18:14.110
I-I am mentioned.

18:14.110 --> 18:16.150
I-I'm part of the rescue team.

18:16.170 --> 18:18.350
Praising the rescue team is praising me,

18:18.350 --> 18:19.060
right, Boss Xie?

18:19.100 --> 18:20.000
Yes.

18:20.000 --> 18:21.440
He's in the photo!

18:21.470 --> 18:23.500
Yes, look at the photo.

18:23.500 --> 18:24.350
He's right there in the photo!

18:24.350 --> 18:25.110
Here he is, see?

18:25.580 --> 18:27.570
Your parents haven't argued lately, have they?

18:28.830 --> 18:29.830
Cut it out and paste it on the wall.

18:29.830 --> 18:31.110
Your dad is amazing.

18:31.110 --> 18:32.070
He's in the newspaper.

18:32.990 --> 18:34.470
You have no idea.

18:34.470 --> 18:35.630
Men are all proud.

18:37.580 --> 18:38.630
Are you crazy?

18:38.630 --> 18:39.260
What are you talking about?

18:40.090 --> 18:40.690
Fenghua!

18:40.720 --> 18:41.270
Here, Siyi.

18:41.310 --> 18:42.630
Try this. It's freshly fried.

18:43.110 --> 18:43.470
Okay.

18:43.550 --> 18:44.150
Be gentle!

18:44.190 --> 18:45.120
Careful. It's hot.

18:45.580 --> 18:46.150
Siyi.

18:46.310 --> 18:47.630
Are you really going to apply to Honghuai Normal University?

18:47.750 --> 18:48.150
Fenghua.

18:49.100 --> 18:50.410
We're all applying to universities in Beijing.

18:50.510 --> 18:51.510
Why don't you apply to a university in Beijing too?

18:51.510 --> 18:52.990
You can bring Grandma there too.

18:53.500 --> 18:53.910
No.

18:54.790 --> 18:55.350
Why not?

18:55.880 --> 18:57.440
The same reason as your dad's.

18:57.580 --> 18:59.180
Not everyone likes Beijing.

18:59.420 --> 19:01.310
Some people are just not suited for that place.

19:01.950 --> 19:03.550
Wait. You've never been there.

19:03.630 --> 19:04.910
How do you know you're not suited for it?

19:05.590 --> 19:06.550
I went to Beijing.

19:06.570 --> 19:07.670
I gave it a try.

19:07.920 --> 19:08.920
So I know

19:08.960 --> 19:10.890
I'm just an ignorant fool.

19:10.990 --> 19:13.310
But when I'm ready, I'll go there again.

19:13.340 --> 19:15.180
This time, I'll start from scratch

19:15.210 --> 19:16.170
and make a name for myself.

19:17.040 --> 19:19.120
Not everyone wants to make a name for themselves.

19:19.150 --> 19:21.310
Exactly. I don't want to.

19:21.330 --> 19:23.090
Then you can just stay at home.

19:23.550 --> 19:24.670
But you're different.

19:24.880 --> 19:26.280
You still have a chance.

19:30.660 --> 19:31.490
Xie Wanghe,

19:31.980 --> 19:34.080
you always talk about success.

19:34.490 --> 19:35.650
That's not wrong.

19:35.750 --> 19:37.190
But everyone's definition of success

19:37.210 --> 19:38.450
is different.

19:38.480 --> 19:40.570
Making a lot of money is just one type of success.

19:40.590 --> 19:41.910
For me,

19:42.370 --> 19:44.130
success is

19:44.150 --> 19:46.180
living the life I want. That's enough.

19:46.790 --> 19:48.550
So what kind of life do you want?

19:49.820 --> 19:51.120
Just the life now.

19:51.340 --> 19:53.340
Every day I wake up, I can see Grandma and my brother,

19:53.360 --> 19:54.360
and I spend most of the day

19:54.390 --> 19:55.960
doing things I enjoy.

19:56.610 --> 19:57.850
Like memorizing vocabulary,

19:57.870 --> 19:59.030
doing schoolwork,

19:59.060 --> 20:00.620
and chatting and fooling around with Fenghua.

20:01.050 --> 20:03.020
I'm very satisfied with my current life.

20:03.050 --> 20:04.010
And I'm content.

20:04.360 --> 20:05.590
People with big dreams like you

20:05.670 --> 20:07.420
can never understand the goals of someone like me.

20:08.550 --> 20:09.150
Well said!

20:09.170 --> 20:09.940
Shut up.

20:10.590 --> 20:11.270
Ma Siyi.

20:12.420 --> 20:14.510
You should try to see the bigger world,

20:14.550 --> 20:15.590
understand?

20:15.780 --> 20:17.210
You're not just someone.

20:29.270 --> 20:30.700
What on earth did you two talk about?

20:45.750 --> 20:47.170
What's wrong with the two of them?

20:58.230 --> 20:59.260
Guys,

20:58.430 --> 21:02.540
[Final battle in June. Let's meet at Tsinghua and Peking.]

20:59.730 --> 21:01.470
this is your final semester

21:01.470 --> 21:02.500
in high school

21:03.630 --> 21:05.630
and the last stretch before the college entrance exam.

21:05.980 --> 21:06.860
The school has decided

21:07.390 --> 21:09.950
to implement full closed-off management for senior students

21:10.550 --> 21:12.200
from Monday to Friday.

21:12.230 --> 21:13.830
Morning reading will start at 6:30 AM,

21:14.430 --> 21:15.390
and you will stay at school overnight.

21:16.030 --> 21:17.270
No one

21:17.710 --> 21:19.790
is allowed to leave the school unless necessary.

21:20.150 --> 21:21.880
Please summon all your strength

21:22.030 --> 21:24.260
[Final battle in June. Let's meet at Tsinghua and Peking.]

21:22.430 --> 21:24.150
and be 100% focused.

21:24.470 --> 21:26.590
Concentrate your time and energy

21:26.630 --> 21:28.390
on the final battle of the college entrance exam.

21:28.430 --> 21:29.920
Do you have confidence?

21:29.830 --> 21:31.310
[Final battle in June. Let's meet at Tsinghua and Peking.]

21:29.920 --> 21:30.910
Yes!

21:31.280 --> 21:32.030
Day student?

21:35.210 --> 21:35.990
No way.

21:35.990 --> 21:38.100
It's against the school's rules.

21:38.230 --> 21:40.070
But my brother is very young.

21:40.070 --> 21:41.270
He needs someone to take care of him.

21:41.270 --> 21:42.680
And my grandma isn't in good health.

21:42.710 --> 21:44.070
I have to look after them at home.

21:48.550 --> 21:49.310
Siyi,

21:50.070 --> 21:51.830
your school performance is quite good,

21:51.870 --> 21:53.270
but your family

21:53.270 --> 21:55.230
has been such a burden on you.

21:55.670 --> 21:57.150
I'm worried that if this continues,

21:57.150 --> 21:58.990
it'll affect your performance in the college entrance exam.

21:59.910 --> 22:02.230
It won't. My ranking didn't drop this time.

22:02.390 --> 22:04.870
I promise to study hard at home.

22:08.740 --> 22:10.960
Alright, I'll apply to the school

22:10.990 --> 22:11.910
to make an exception for you,

22:11.910 --> 22:12.870
allowing you to be a day student.

22:13.160 --> 22:14.670
But you must remember,

22:14.990 --> 22:15.670
don't waste a minute.

22:15.710 --> 22:17.710
Make the most of the last semester.

22:19.550 --> 22:20.550
Thank you, madam.

22:26.870 --> 22:27.630
Siyi.

22:28.420 --> 22:29.230
Do you have a moment?

22:29.620 --> 22:30.390
Let's talk.

22:44.470 --> 22:46.590
You'd better not be a day student.

22:47.100 --> 22:49.150
This semester is crucial.

22:50.710 --> 22:53.460
You know how things are with my family.

22:53.790 --> 22:55.030
Are there no other options?

22:55.500 --> 22:56.860
What options do I have?

22:57.190 --> 22:58.310
My brother needs to go to school.

22:58.500 --> 23:00.040
Grandma might be hospitalized at any time.

23:00.830 --> 23:02.180
If I don't go back to keep an eye on things,

23:02.200 --> 23:03.690
something could go wrong at any moment.

23:05.820 --> 23:07.060
What about hiring a caregiver?

23:08.270 --> 23:09.790
Do you think I can afford a caregiver?

23:09.870 --> 23:10.950
I can lend you money.

23:11.810 --> 23:12.640
Don't worry.

23:12.870 --> 23:14.600
I won't ask my parents for it.

23:14.750 --> 23:16.910
I'll lend you the pocket money I've saved up.

23:16.950 --> 23:17.950
It should be enough.

23:25.500 --> 23:26.440
Chen Rui.

23:27.150 --> 23:28.510
You've always been very nice to me.

23:29.150 --> 23:30.310
I'm grateful.

23:30.750 --> 23:32.310
I already felt indebted to you

23:32.650 --> 23:34.210
when I went to your house for free classes.

23:34.700 --> 23:36.260
I shouldn't take advantage of your kindness.

23:37.790 --> 23:38.760
Thank you.

23:45.230 --> 23:46.190
I don't know how it happened.

23:46.190 --> 23:47.910
It just suddenly popped up, you know?

23:48.070 --> 23:50.590
Look, she's wearing a floral bra.

23:50.630 --> 23:52.060
She even has boobs.

23:52.150 --> 23:53.510
Yeah.

23:53.510 --> 23:55.030
Fenghua isn't like this.

23:55.030 --> 23:56.400
What are you looking at?

23:57.390 --> 23:58.360
Show me.

23:59.510 --> 24:01.070
Show me!

24:05.470 --> 24:07.760
Fenghua, did someone take your picture without you knowing?

24:10.540 --> 24:11.510
What's it?

24:15.060 --> 24:15.870
Give it to me!

24:24.470 --> 24:25.230
Fenghua!

24:28.030 --> 24:29.110
What's on the phone?

24:37.090 --> 24:40.610
[Select] [Return]

24:38.080 --> 24:39.570
Are you sure you didn't take these photos?

24:40.140 --> 24:41.420
You think I'm crazy?

24:42.070 --> 24:43.680
Dressing like that for photos.

24:43.950 --> 24:45.330
They're obviously photoshopped.

24:45.670 --> 24:46.990
Then it's no big deal, Fenghua.

24:48.210 --> 24:49.210
File a complaint.

24:49.340 --> 24:50.110
Contact the website administrator

24:50.150 --> 24:50.950
to delete the post.

24:51.140 --> 24:52.390
It's a private forum.

24:53.070 --> 24:55.240
If its administrator refuses, we can't delete the post.

24:55.620 --> 24:57.340
Can't we hack in?

24:57.790 --> 24:59.110
That takes time.

25:00.550 --> 25:02.310
Word has spread.

25:02.310 --> 25:04.790
I'm afraid it'll affect Fenghua's reputation.

25:04.870 --> 25:06.240
And the person who posted it said

25:06.550 --> 25:07.910
this is just an appetizer.

25:07.950 --> 25:09.300
There's more juicy content to come.

25:11.690 --> 25:14.990
[Forum Homepage]

25:17.950 --> 25:19.700
What should I do?

25:19.750 --> 25:21.390
What should I do?

25:36.460 --> 25:39.690
Good. More alluring. Gorgeous.

25:40.150 --> 25:42.380
What a big star!

25:42.460 --> 25:43.630
Gorgeous!

25:43.630 --> 25:44.360
Pang Dahai!

25:44.470 --> 25:45.600
One more.

25:46.870 --> 25:47.870
How could you do that?

25:47.870 --> 25:48.870
Who let you in?

25:48.870 --> 25:49.640
Get out!

25:49.670 --> 25:50.950
She's underage.

25:50.990 --> 25:53.380
Aren't you afraid of karma for doing such a thing?

25:54.310 --> 25:55.760
She should've returned my money.

25:55.990 --> 25:58.070
Every action has consequences. She deserves it.

25:58.070 --> 26:00.830
I'm telling you. This is just the beginning.

26:03.830 --> 26:05.310
You're crazy!

26:11.770 --> 26:12.710
Call the police!

26:15.230 --> 26:16.050
Scum!

26:18.210 --> 26:19.300
Scum!

26:23.920 --> 26:24.830
Scum!

26:27.100 --> 26:28.290
I told you

26:28.740 --> 26:30.390
to keep it between you and me

26:30.430 --> 26:31.860
and leave Fenghua alone!

26:32.470 --> 26:34.190
Leave Fenghua alone!

26:38.210 --> 26:39.640
You little bastard.

26:40.390 --> 26:42.030
You're finished.

26:43.810 --> 26:44.760
Look.

26:44.780 --> 26:46.410
Your parents are right there.

26:49.350 --> 26:50.850
The boy is safe.

26:50.940 --> 26:52.910
Your parents are on the bank.

26:52.990 --> 26:54.030
Thank goodness. He's fine.

26:54.030 --> 26:54.960
Look.

26:56.530 --> 26:57.950
Well done!

26:58.670 --> 27:00.590
Come on, give us a hand.

27:02.150 --> 27:03.030
Applause.

27:05.310 --> 27:06.150
Careful, careful.

27:06.180 --> 27:07.670
-Thank you.
-Be careful.

27:07.670 --> 27:08.840
Thank you, sir.

27:10.710 --> 27:11.790
Please make way.

27:11.790 --> 27:12.790
Alright.

27:12.790 --> 27:13.310
Watch your step.

27:13.310 --> 27:14.230
Careful.

27:14.260 --> 27:15.470
What's wrong with you?

27:15.470 --> 27:16.570
Why are you so naughty?

27:16.710 --> 27:18.150
Don't hit him! Don't hit him!

27:18.190 --> 27:18.750
Enough.

27:18.750 --> 27:21.750
Don't let the boy wander by the river again.

27:22.270 --> 27:23.190
Thank you.

27:23.230 --> 27:25.070
Get up, get up.

27:25.070 --> 27:25.830
Your phone's ringing.

27:31.830 --> 27:33.610
This is Xie Tiancheng. What's the matter?

27:35.010 --> 27:36.030
Is the boy okay?

27:36.030 --> 27:37.320
He's alright.

27:37.510 --> 27:38.870
Watch him closely.

27:38.890 --> 27:40.360
Just keep a close eye on him.

27:41.560 --> 27:42.730
Keep a close eye on him.

27:42.760 --> 27:44.200
Where is he now?

27:45.960 --> 27:47.440
Thank God the boy is alright.

27:47.440 --> 27:48.550
Thank you, guys.

27:48.710 --> 27:49.310
Okay.

27:49.830 --> 27:51.790
I-I-I'll be right there.

28:22.560 --> 28:23.770
You guys go ahead.

28:23.930 --> 28:26.090
I need to deal with something here.

28:26.170 --> 28:26.850
Yong, Yong.

28:26.880 --> 28:28.000
Okay, I got it.

28:27.820 --> 28:29.370
[Flower Street Police Station]

28:28.040 --> 28:29.560
Alright, bye.

28:29.590 --> 28:30.370
What took you so long?

28:30.410 --> 28:31.210
Where is he?

28:31.380 --> 28:32.910
Still downtown. He's been detained.

28:32.930 --> 28:34.150
They asked him

28:34.150 --> 28:35.390
for his family's number.

28:35.390 --> 28:36.190
He gave them my number.

28:36.190 --> 28:37.310
I guess he didn't want you to worry.

28:37.420 --> 28:39.080
Who did he beat?

28:39.190 --> 28:40.230
A photographer.

28:40.260 --> 28:41.230
Not only did he beat him,

28:41.230 --> 28:42.470
but he also trashed his photo studio.

28:42.490 --> 28:43.950
This is very serious.

28:44.000 --> 28:45.910
If it's not handled well, he could go to prison.

28:45.950 --> 28:46.390
Get in the car.

28:53.300 --> 28:54.740
Wanghe is a good boy.

28:54.780 --> 28:56.020
He has a strong sense of justice, just like you.

28:56.930 --> 28:59.290
But he's got quite a temper.

28:59.310 --> 29:01.330
He acts without considering the consequences.

29:03.430 --> 29:06.140
Wanghe wouldn't be the one who started it.

29:06.340 --> 29:07.110
He must have done that

29:07.150 --> 29:08.390
for a reason.

29:13.870 --> 29:20.600
[Police]

29:24.460 --> 29:28.640
[Tangbei Police Station]
[Reception Hall]

29:35.000 --> 29:36.480
Yong, have some water.

29:36.480 --> 29:37.800
Alright, sit.

29:38.030 --> 29:39.070
Where's the boy?

29:39.090 --> 29:40.970
He's detained. He won't say a word when questioned.

29:41.000 --> 29:42.040
He said he'd wait for you.

29:42.070 --> 29:44.670
We scared him a bit, and he asked for a lawyer.

29:45.430 --> 29:46.830
He watched too many Hong Kong movies.

29:47.130 --> 29:48.150
I want to ask,

29:48.190 --> 29:49.860
how is the man he hit?

29:49.880 --> 29:51.150
He's been sent to the hospital.

29:51.170 --> 29:52.290
We don't know the specifics.

29:52.670 --> 29:53.990
I advise you

29:54.020 --> 29:56.490
to go meet the victim

29:56.520 --> 29:57.520
and try to get his forgiveness.

29:58.430 --> 30:00.230
If he refuses

30:00.260 --> 30:01.650
and insists on a forensic medical examination,

30:01.690 --> 30:03.640
and it confirms an injury,

30:03.800 --> 30:05.560
your son's future will be ruined.

30:08.960 --> 30:10.610
Forgive him?

30:11.700 --> 30:13.380
Like hell I will!

30:14.800 --> 30:17.600
I was taking photos just fine.

30:17.630 --> 30:19.320
He came in and smashed things.

30:20.130 --> 30:20.810
What?

30:21.200 --> 30:23.390
Am I a pushover?

30:24.310 --> 30:25.710
Listen!

30:26.620 --> 30:27.820
I'm not short of money.

30:29.100 --> 30:31.620
I'll make sure he rots in jail!

30:32.200 --> 30:32.760
Get lost!

31:08.150 --> 31:08.870
Honey.

31:10.180 --> 31:11.940
You need to come back right away.

31:13.980 --> 31:14.770
What's wrong?

31:18.630 --> 31:19.660
Chen.

31:21.410 --> 31:22.220
Chen!

31:22.810 --> 31:23.820
Liang.

31:23.850 --> 31:24.990
Why don't you take a break?

31:24.990 --> 31:25.870
I'll drive.

31:25.870 --> 31:26.750
Chen, listen to me.

31:26.750 --> 31:28.180
I need to go home immediately.

31:28.750 --> 31:29.950
There are over 400 kilometers left.

31:29.970 --> 31:31.100
You'll have to drive alone.

31:31.140 --> 31:32.540
I'll give you all the money

31:32.640 --> 31:33.510
for this trip.

31:34.270 --> 31:34.730
Okay?

31:37.800 --> 31:39.460
Give me my things!

31:45.310 --> 31:46.380
You're back.

31:46.710 --> 31:47.510
Where's our son?

31:47.950 --> 31:50.420
H-He's still in detention.

31:50.630 --> 31:52.650
What were you doing?

31:53.310 --> 31:54.910
What were you doing when our son got in trouble?

31:54.940 --> 31:56.340
Where were you?

31:56.370 --> 31:58.400
Is this how you looked after our son when I was away?

32:00.790 --> 32:03.220
All you do is drink!

32:03.630 --> 32:04.780
Drink yourself to death!

32:18.270 --> 32:22.560
[Petition Letter]

32:21.940 --> 32:22.550
How many?

32:24.430 --> 32:25.450
How many do you get there?

32:26.450 --> 32:27.430
Ten.

32:27.530 --> 32:27.970
Ten.

32:27.990 --> 32:29.080
48 here.

32:29.120 --> 32:29.980
48.

32:31.680 --> 32:32.680
Granny Ma.

32:32.720 --> 32:33.550
She's worried.

32:33.550 --> 32:34.470
You should stay at home.

32:34.490 --> 32:35.430
Granny Ma.

32:35.470 --> 32:36.390
Careful, careful.

32:36.410 --> 32:37.870
I just came to listen.

32:37.890 --> 32:38.630
Have a seat.

32:38.630 --> 32:39.760
Careful, careful.

32:40.960 --> 32:42.010
Alright.

32:42.060 --> 32:43.270
Don't mind me.

32:43.880 --> 32:45.140
We've already

32:45.190 --> 32:46.780
collected signatures from 124 households

32:46.800 --> 32:48.840
on Flower Street.

32:49.680 --> 32:50.800
The neighborhood committee

32:51.150 --> 32:53.410
and their school will also step in.

32:53.890 --> 32:55.420
What's the school's attitude?

32:55.440 --> 32:57.080
The school already knows the whole story.

32:57.110 --> 32:58.030
The principal thinks

32:58.060 --> 32:59.650
what Wanghe did is understandable,

32:59.680 --> 33:01.370
but he doesn't encourage

33:01.390 --> 33:02.160
or support his behavior.

33:02.350 --> 33:03.150
Gosh,

33:03.180 --> 33:05.020
that doesn't mean anything.

33:05.040 --> 33:06.670
Officer Shen just called.

33:06.690 --> 33:08.930
The police station is planning

33:08.970 --> 33:10.360
to arrange a mediation tomorrow.

33:10.390 --> 33:12.120
They want to know our conditions.

33:12.790 --> 33:13.950
Conditions?

33:14.250 --> 33:16.170
I went to the hospital to see that guy.

33:16.200 --> 33:17.450
He's a tough nut to crack.

33:17.470 --> 33:18.940
He won't settle this with us peacefully.

33:18.980 --> 33:20.600
That bastard started it!

33:20.630 --> 33:21.700
Shut up!

33:21.740 --> 33:22.500
It's true.

33:22.520 --> 33:23.220
Xingchi.

33:23.260 --> 33:24.420
It is true.

33:24.440 --> 33:25.490
That guy

33:26.230 --> 33:27.910
photoshopped Fenghua's underwear photos

33:27.950 --> 33:29.030
and posted them online.

33:29.110 --> 33:29.930
What?

33:29.990 --> 33:31.150
Wait a minute.

33:31.580 --> 33:32.900
Fenghua's

33:32.920 --> 33:34.240
underwear photos

33:34.270 --> 33:35.070
are online?

33:35.140 --> 33:35.880
Calm down.

33:35.910 --> 33:36.430
Wait.

33:36.430 --> 33:37.030
Make it clear.

33:37.070 --> 33:37.950
Here's what happened.

33:38.000 --> 33:38.720
Well,

33:38.740 --> 33:39.620
he put Fenghua's face

33:39.660 --> 33:41.060
on someone else's body

33:41.100 --> 33:42.140
and then posted the photos online.

33:42.160 --> 33:43.120
And he posted the link

33:43.150 --> 33:44.190
in our school's online forum.

33:44.230 --> 33:45.270
Wanghe was mad after finding it out.

33:45.270 --> 33:46.630
So he beat that guy up.

33:46.790 --> 33:48.220
Zhou Haikuo, why didn't you…

33:48.640 --> 33:50.610
Why didn't you tell us this earlier?

33:50.670 --> 33:51.710
Who do you think you are?

33:51.740 --> 33:54.810
You think you can handle this by yourselves?

33:54.990 --> 33:56.030
What should we do?

33:56.070 --> 33:57.230
I'm completely at a loss.

33:57.270 --> 33:58.620
Don't panic, don't panic.

33:58.670 --> 33:59.860
What's the situation now?

33:59.900 --> 34:00.610
Where are the photos?

34:00.640 --> 34:01.290
We discovered it early

34:01.310 --> 34:01.910
and found the source.

34:01.990 --> 34:02.550
They've already been deleted.

34:02.570 --> 34:03.680
The school has intervened.

34:03.750 --> 34:04.500
Are you sure they're deleted?

34:04.500 --> 34:05.350
Yes, yes.

34:05.880 --> 34:08.560
So Wanghe did this for Fenghua!

34:08.699 --> 34:09.820
You guys,

34:10.030 --> 34:11.889
why didn't you stop him in the first place?

34:11.949 --> 34:12.949
Wanghe went on his own.

34:12.949 --> 34:13.790
He didn't tell us.

34:13.790 --> 34:15.550
We both only found out afterward.

34:15.600 --> 34:17.340
How did you know it was that guy?

34:17.980 --> 34:18.630
Yeah.

34:18.650 --> 34:19.290
Is there any evidence?

34:21.429 --> 34:22.030
No.

34:22.030 --> 34:23.400
I checked the IP address.

34:23.670 --> 34:24.989
He used a proxy server,

34:24.989 --> 34:26.030
so it's hard to trace.

34:28.380 --> 34:30.230
But I think

34:30.250 --> 34:32.830
he's the one who took the original photos.

34:32.850 --> 34:33.850
That's a clue.

34:33.880 --> 34:36.520
But we need to file a police report first.

34:36.550 --> 34:37.150
Report it to the police!

34:37.179 --> 34:37.770
We must report it to the police!

34:37.800 --> 34:38.679
He should be arrested!

34:38.900 --> 34:40.070
Will that help?

34:40.100 --> 34:41.300
This isn't evidence.

34:41.320 --> 34:43.120
Can you prove he broke the law?

34:43.159 --> 34:44.830
He was just trying to give us trouble.

34:46.290 --> 34:47.330
Wait.

34:47.360 --> 34:50.120
Isn't the boy still detained?

34:50.139 --> 34:52.219
Let's get him out

34:52.250 --> 34:54.100
before discussing other matters, okay?

34:54.120 --> 34:55.040
Yes, yes.

34:55.070 --> 34:55.949
Let's get him out first.

34:55.969 --> 34:57.170
He's the most important now.

34:57.200 --> 34:57.690
Right.

34:57.710 --> 34:58.590
What did the police say?

35:02.100 --> 35:03.440
The police said

35:03.580 --> 35:05.020
we should pay for the damage

35:05.790 --> 35:07.680
and try to meet all his conditions.

35:07.710 --> 35:10.110
This way, Wanghe might be able to come out

35:10.140 --> 35:11.060
and not miss the college entrance exam.

35:11.870 --> 35:13.470
He's a rotten rogue!

35:13.490 --> 35:15.200
We're to pay him?

35:15.220 --> 35:16.390
How's that possible?

35:16.420 --> 35:17.940
S-Stop.

35:17.970 --> 35:19.610
We'll pay him.

35:19.650 --> 35:21.780
T-This is not about money, okay?

35:22.410 --> 35:23.830
Then what do you want to do?

35:23.870 --> 35:25.190
Do you want to make things worse

35:25.230 --> 35:26.750
and let your son stay in the police station?

35:26.890 --> 35:28.060
That's not what I mean!

35:28.090 --> 35:29.620
What's the use of shouting like this?

35:29.640 --> 35:32.000
You'll only make things worse and keep our son detained!

35:32.030 --> 35:34.090
We should get him out!

35:34.150 --> 35:35.230
Alright. Alright.

35:35.230 --> 35:36.270
We have to find a way!

35:36.270 --> 35:37.870
Calm down and solve this step by step.

35:37.870 --> 35:38.750
Aren't we

35:38.750 --> 35:40.150
trying to find a solution?

35:41.380 --> 35:41.990
Alright.

35:41.990 --> 35:42.830
Stop crying.

35:43.510 --> 35:44.470
Enough.

35:45.070 --> 35:46.590
It's just detention.

35:46.630 --> 35:47.600
He'll be out in a couple of days.

35:47.670 --> 35:48.470
Everything will be fine.

35:51.720 --> 35:54.470
Wanghe was able to go to college.

35:55.420 --> 35:57.810
But because of me…

35:58.860 --> 36:00.100
No matter how indebted you are to him,

36:00.720 --> 36:02.510
you can pay it back bit by bit.

36:03.870 --> 36:06.520
I'm afraid I can't pay it back.

36:06.550 --> 36:08.820
You can if you want to.

36:10.460 --> 36:11.980
Wanghe sees you as his sister.

36:12.010 --> 36:13.230
He stood up for you.

36:13.480 --> 36:15.530
We must remember his kindness.

36:16.070 --> 36:16.960
Let me tell you,

36:17.000 --> 36:18.590
no matter how it ends for Wanghe,

36:18.590 --> 36:19.910
we'll face it with him.

36:20.270 --> 36:21.270
If he's in debt,

36:21.300 --> 36:22.210
we'll pay it together.

36:22.940 --> 36:24.780
Don't pull me!

36:24.810 --> 36:26.720
I have something to do with Haikuo!

36:28.360 --> 36:28.850
[Heaven rewards the diligent]

36:28.870 --> 36:31.250
Xingchi, your dad means well.

36:31.270 --> 36:32.820
He's afraid you'll get implicated.

36:32.870 --> 36:34.470
Why would I be implicated?

36:34.500 --> 36:35.960
Wanghe didn't do anything wrong!

36:36.100 --> 36:37.180
Come back!

36:36.320 --> 36:41.400
[Heaven rewards the diligent]

36:38.570 --> 36:40.750
If he didn't do anything wrong, why have the police arrested him?

36:41.320 --> 36:43.780
What is the law made for?

36:43.960 --> 36:47.350
The law is made to maintain social stability!

36:47.590 --> 36:51.140
That gangster style of settling scores doesn't work!

36:51.770 --> 36:53.170
Then let me ask you, Dad.

36:53.210 --> 36:54.350
Fenghua was bullied.

36:54.350 --> 36:55.110
Should we help her or not?

36:55.130 --> 36:55.890
You should!

36:55.950 --> 36:56.990
Of course you should!

36:57.900 --> 37:00.960
But you should have principles and strategies.

37:00.990 --> 37:02.630
You can't act recklessly, boy!

37:02.650 --> 37:03.170
Right.

37:03.420 --> 37:04.300
Fine.

37:04.330 --> 37:05.720
I'm telling you about this now.

37:05.860 --> 37:08.130
You tell me, how should we get back at that rogue?

37:09.870 --> 37:11.800
Let's find a lawyer to sue him.

37:11.820 --> 37:13.900
Didn't you just say?

37:13.930 --> 37:14.930
This won't hold up in court.

37:14.950 --> 37:15.830
The law can't punish him.

37:15.870 --> 37:17.150
He just wanted to give us trouble.

37:17.170 --> 37:17.890
Then...

37:17.920 --> 37:18.680
Then what?

37:47.420 --> 37:53.940
[Police]

37:54.110 --> 37:57.410
[People's Mediation Rooms]

37:54.270 --> 37:58.750
This is the Tangbei Police Station in Qingtang District, Honghuai City.

37:57.410 --> 38:00.030
[Meditation Room 2]

38:00.430 --> 38:01.980
Both parties involved are here.

38:02.570 --> 38:04.990
Today, we're having this mediation meeting

38:05.110 --> 38:06.990
to clarify the legal responsibilities of both parties,

38:06.990 --> 38:09.150
not to simply sweep things under the rug.

38:09.170 --> 38:10.530
You've all watched

38:09.260 --> 38:19.160
[Mediator]

38:10.570 --> 38:11.810
the security footage.

38:13.650 --> 38:15.650
Xie Wanghe rushed in and smashed things,

38:15.670 --> 38:16.850
but he didn't hurt anyone.

38:17.470 --> 38:19.110
Pang Dahai was the first to get physical.

38:19.310 --> 38:21.610
Xie Wanghe only retaliated after being attacked.

38:22.270 --> 38:23.560
What else could I do?

38:23.580 --> 38:25.140
I was supposed to just watch him smash things?

38:25.160 --> 38:27.780
That light alone was very expensive.

38:28.220 --> 38:29.670
If I hadn't stopped him,

38:29.750 --> 38:30.910
I'd have gone bankrupt from the damage.

38:31.470 --> 38:33.300
Regardless of the cause,

38:33.330 --> 38:36.190
the offender committed the crime of picking quarrels and making trouble.

38:36.270 --> 38:37.270
Today, we're here to see

38:37.270 --> 38:39.670
if you can reach an understanding

38:39.750 --> 38:42.150
to minimize the legal consequences of this case.

38:55.310 --> 38:56.200
Alright.

38:56.300 --> 38:58.160
If both parties disagree,

38:58.200 --> 38:59.830
we'll proceed as we should,

38:59.860 --> 39:01.860
with detention or sentence as necessary.

39:02.520 --> 39:03.700
Think it through.

39:11.870 --> 39:14.510
Can I speak to him privately for a moment?

39:18.690 --> 39:19.810
Thank you.

39:35.840 --> 39:36.960
This time,

39:37.790 --> 39:39.510
it was indeed my son's fault.

39:40.740 --> 39:42.220
I apologize to you.

39:44.430 --> 39:45.890
Apologizing now

39:47.130 --> 39:48.730
is a bit late, isn't it?

39:55.580 --> 39:56.900
The reason

39:57.620 --> 39:59.240
why he beat you,

40:00.460 --> 40:03.540
you know better than anyone, don't you?

40:04.180 --> 40:05.070
What do you mean?

40:05.510 --> 40:06.860
Fenghua

40:06.970 --> 40:08.310
is still in school.

40:08.840 --> 40:11.110
How could you do such a thing to a young girl?

40:11.380 --> 40:12.540
Don't you think

40:14.410 --> 40:15.660
it's despicable?

40:19.140 --> 40:20.750
W-What did I do?

40:21.140 --> 40:22.080
Playing dumb, huh?

40:24.300 --> 40:26.030
You're a man.

40:26.520 --> 40:28.240
Just own up to what you did.

40:28.790 --> 40:29.670
What did I do?

40:29.690 --> 40:31.050
What should I own up to?

40:31.890 --> 40:32.640
Let me tell you.

40:32.660 --> 40:33.900
Don't talk nonsense here.

40:33.940 --> 40:35.080
This is the police station.

40:35.150 --> 40:36.420
I'll sue you for defamation.

40:45.110 --> 40:45.920
Anyway,

40:47.960 --> 40:49.810
he's my only son.

40:51.800 --> 40:53.800
You've met me

40:54.240 --> 40:56.730
and my husband.

40:56.760 --> 40:58.520
Both of us are very ordinary.

40:58.540 --> 40:59.500
In this life,

41:00.890 --> 41:03.140
we only hope our son can

41:03.910 --> 41:04.910
make something of himself.

41:06.430 --> 41:09.710
If you crush our only hope,

41:11.380 --> 41:12.860
don't blame us

41:13.030 --> 41:14.500
for dragging you down.

41:16.250 --> 41:17.550
Are you threatening me?

41:17.570 --> 41:18.800
I'm not threatening you.

41:19.610 --> 41:20.730
I'm negotiating with you.

41:21.800 --> 41:23.630
I'm not asking you to put yourself in our shoes.

41:23.990 --> 41:25.180
I'm just asking you

41:26.960 --> 41:28.930
not to ruin the futures

41:30.100 --> 41:31.460
of both our families.

41:35.950 --> 41:37.390
I'm begging you.

41:52.620 --> 41:53.660
Let's do the math.

41:52.720 --> 41:56.460
[Mediator]

41:54.600 --> 41:55.660
Well,

41:55.710 --> 41:56.680
medical treatment

41:56.710 --> 41:58.300
has cost about 30,000 yuan.

41:59.700 --> 42:01.870
Recovering from these injuries

42:02.110 --> 42:03.310
will cost quite a bit too, right?

42:04.910 --> 42:08.070
And the smashed cameras and computers,

42:08.070 --> 42:10.630
all these odds and ends,

42:10.630 --> 42:11.760
if you add them up…

42:14.180 --> 42:15.300
100,000 yuan.

42:15.320 --> 42:16.230
That should settle this matter.

42:16.270 --> 42:16.980
100,000?

42:18.310 --> 42:19.960
Why don't you just rob a bank?

42:21.560 --> 42:23.130
100,000 it is.

42:23.160 --> 42:25.040
Let's sign the agreement now.

42:26.380 --> 42:27.600
Are you sure?

42:27.630 --> 42:28.670
Wait.

42:28.700 --> 42:29.580
Listen.

42:29.610 --> 42:31.400
It must be paid in full at once.

42:32.050 --> 42:33.290
Paid in full at once?

42:33.310 --> 42:34.240
You're really pushing it, aren't you?

42:34.270 --> 42:35.320
No problem.

42:35.340 --> 42:36.450
If you hadn't done that despicable thing…

42:36.510 --> 42:37.070
No problem.

42:37.070 --> 42:38.570
could my son have beaten you up?

42:38.770 --> 42:39.330
Alright, stop.

42:39.370 --> 42:40.610
This is the police station.

42:40.640 --> 42:42.670
This is the police station!

42:43.350 --> 42:43.950
Stop yelling.

42:43.990 --> 42:45.910
It's already settled. Stop arguing.

42:45.910 --> 42:46.990
Do you know where you are?

42:46.990 --> 42:47.990
Alright. Don't listen to him.

42:48.030 --> 42:49.350
I can make the decision on this matter.

42:49.390 --> 42:50.270
You can't!

42:50.310 --> 42:51.150
Don't get yourself arrested!

42:51.150 --> 42:51.990
It's 100,000 yuan!

42:52.030 --> 42:52.790
Shut up!

42:58.110 --> 42:58.630
I'll sign.
